# ==========================================
# Flutter / Dart Monorepo .gitignore
# ==========================================

# Flutter & Dart build artifacts anywhere in the repository
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/pubspec.lock

# Android build & key files
**/android/app/debug/
**/android/app/profile/
**/android/app/release/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/local.properties
**/android/captures/

# iOS / macOS build artifacts & secrets
**/ios/Flutter/App.framework
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.framework
**/ios/Flutter/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.h
**/ios/Flutter/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.m
**/ios/Flutter/app.config
**/ios/Runner.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace
**/ios/Runner.gitignore
**/Pods/
**/.symlinks/

# IDE & Editor system files
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.iml
**/*.ipr
**/*.iws
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# OS generated files
**/.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store?
**/._*
**/.Spotlight-V100
**/.Trashes
**/ehthumbs.db
**/Thumbs.db

# Log files
**/*.log